NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000413 "the same terms as the Perl 5 programming language system itself."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000414 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000415 "=head1 BUGS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000416 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000417 "Please report any bugs or feature requests on the bugtracker website L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=Getopt-Long-Complete>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000418 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000419 "When submitting a bug or request, please include a test-file or a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000420 "patch to an existing test-file that illustrates the bug or desired"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000421 "feature."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000422 ""
